Package: emberui
Title: Interactive Inputs for Ember Notebooks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jonathan", "Chen", email = "jonathanwchen@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sliders, number boxes, checkboxes, text boxes, dropdowns and
    radio buttons for Ember notebooks, alone or several together as one
    input. In Ember, an input assigned to a
    name becomes a widget, and moving it reruns the cells that read the
    name. Anywhere else (Rscript, the R console, knitr) each function
    checks its arguments and returns its default value.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
